From: openEuler RISC-V Maintainers <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] include QGuiApplication for activation and screen queries

License: GPL-3.0-or-later
Upstream-Status: downstream-only
Origin: exact-source audit and runs 34686802262 and 34687737850

The surface activation code and the QML session-lock code both use
QGuiApplication without including its declaration. The Qt 6.5 private
headers do not provide it transitively. Include the public QtGui header
directly in both translation units; all Wayland functionality is unchanged.

Remove when upstream directly includes QGuiApplication in both files.

--- a/src/qwaylandextsessionlocksurface.cpp
+++ b/src/qwaylandextsessionlocksurface.cpp
@@ -4,2 +4,3 @@

+#include <QtGui/QGuiApplication>
 #include <QtWaylandClient/private/qwaylandinputdevice_p.h>
--- a/src/qml/SessionLock.cpp
+++ b/src/qml/SessionLock.cpp
@@ -3,4 +3,5 @@
 #include "window.h"
 #include <QDebug>
+#include <QtGui/QGuiApplication>
 #include <private/qwaylandscreen_p.h>
 #include <private/qwaylandsurface_p.h>
